                      "name": "Paragraph",
                      "fill": "$ult-color-text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The registry serves a moving latest with no versioned URLs. Every served file carries an item stamp, so having the file is the pin.",
