              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 380,
              "content": "Components ship in Neutral: achromatic accent, focus and highlight. The Ultima preset adds an arcane accent and a mana highlight, and this site keeps the mana. Verdant, ember and ruin carry status in both. Preview a preset, or build one from any color in Theme Studio.",
